{"3430450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Graveyard Simulator", "steam_appid": 3430450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/6a91f33aa58b24c265bd813877d733a6.avif?t=1786619183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras_big/6a91f33aa58b24c265bd813877d733a6.avif?t=1786619183 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the dead turn into zombies, your job is to manage your very own Graveyard! Perform burials and cremations, fulfill visitor requests, manage facilities, and keep your staff and defenses in top shape. <strong>But when night falls, everything changes</strong>. The dead may rest, but the zombies don’t. They are coming for your precious work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/cf4c0c85efa6b8b7b1c050c145f941e5.poster.avif?t=1786619183\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/cf4c0c85efa6b8b7b1c050c145f941e5.webm?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/cf4c0c85efa6b8b7b1c050c145f941e5.mp4?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visitor Satisfaction is Key</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After processing the bodies, visitors will return to check on their loved ones. Your duty is to keep graves intact while providing fresh flowers and maintaining a welcoming environment. Every visit rewards you with valuable bonuses to help your business thrive.<br><br>Visitors can also stop by the <strong>Chapel</strong> to rest, attend sermons, and browse the <strong>Souvenir Shop</strong> for small keepsakes like candles and incenses. A clean, decorated, and well managed graveyard encourages greater generosity while donating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/696b92ff11372a2a8eba453968450c1a.poster.avif?t=1786619183\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/696b92ff11372a2a8eba453968450c1a.webm?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/696b92ff11372a2a8eba453968450c1a.mp4?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your Defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, waves of zombies will come with their numbers growing and special zombie types emerging, hungry for freshly buried bodies and for you. Some nights may be even more dangerous with special events like the Blood Moon. From basic defenses like barbed wires and fences to advanced machines like flamethrower turrets, keep your defenses upgraded, repaired, and fully stocked with ammo to withstand the night. Your loyal pet companion can also assist you during nighttime defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ef09ee91a73fa8eb14416887afad400a.poster.avif?t=1786619183\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ef09ee91a73fa8eb14416887afad400a.webm?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ef09ee91a73fa8eb14416887afad400a.mp4?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust your Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide arsenal of 13+ weapons, including pistols, rifles, shotguns, and your trusty shovel, you are the ultimate force against the Zombies. As you level up, unlock and purchase new weapons to become even stronger. Just make sure to stock up on enough ammo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/bf9f1c77076478af514eaeea394eb19d.poster.avif?t=1786619183\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/bf9f1c77076478af514eaeea394eb19d.webm?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/bf9f1c77076478af514eaeea394eb19d.mp4?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Even a Graveyard Can Be Cozy Sometimes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Farming Area to grow different flowers for profit and vegetables to simply eat and restore your energy and health. With Upgrades, you can even unlock a Grinder to turn zombie parts into Fertilizer. Decorate your Graveyard with benches, lights, paths, custom urns, and other ornaments to make it truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/918d390b682dbc181bca4d52e2558959.poster.avif?t=1786619183\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/918d390b682dbc181bca4d52e2558959.webm?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/918d390b682dbc181bca4d52e2558959.mp4?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand and Upgrade Your Facilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your graveyard isn’t just a resting place, it's a business, and every upgrade matters. Expand your <strong>burial areas</strong>, manage <strong>custom urns</strong> at the urn station, upgrade your <strong>crematorium</strong>, and operate new facilities like the <strong>Stone Quarry &amp; Workshop</strong> to craft your own gravestones. Improve your <strong>water supply</strong>, manage <strong>resource production</strong>, and unlock advanced stations like the <strong>Zombie Research Lab</strong> to process captured zombies into valuable products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire a team of employees to help with day-to-day tasks: the <strong>Florist</strong> keeps flowers running, the <strong>Gravekeeper</strong> maintains burials and cremations, the <strong>Gardener</strong> keeps your farm in check, the <strong>Technician</strong> ensures all machines run smoothly, and Chapel staff like the <strong>Priest</strong>, <strong>Pianist</strong>, and <strong>Custodian</strong> help run sermons and services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every improvement helps you stay one step ahead of both business demands and the undead threat. Venture beyond the graveyard by unlocking <strong>Expedition Mode</strong> through the <strong>Expedition Station</strong>, where radio signals lead you to dangerous missions outside your walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and expand your own graveyard while balancing business and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and maintain defenses against nightly zombie attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform burials, cremations, urn deliveries, and keep visitors satisfied</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a Chapel with sermons, donations, and a Souvenir Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and manage a wide range of employees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft gravestones, customize urns, and produce valuable resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Expedition Mode and complete missions outside the graveyard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your Graveyard with benches, lights, paths, bushes and other ornaments to make it truly your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle with expanded game modifier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a mix of management, strategy, and first-person action</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the dead turn into zombies, your job is to manage your very own Graveyard! Perform burials and cremations, fulfill visitor requests, manage facilities, and keep your staff and defenses in top shape. <strong>But when night falls, everything changes</strong>. The dead may rest, but the zombies don’t. They are coming for your precious work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/cf4c0c85efa6b8b7b1c050c145f941e5.poster.avif?t=1786619183\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/cf4c0c85efa6b8b7b1c050c145f941e5.webm?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr