ur loyal pet companion can also assist you during nighttime defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ef09ee91a73fa8eb14416887afad400a.poster.avif?t=1786619183\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ef09ee91a73fa8eb14416887afad400a.webm?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ef09ee91a73fa8eb14416887afad400a.mp4?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust your Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide arsenal of 13+ weapons, including pistols, rifles, shotguns, and your trusty shovel, you are the ultimate force against the Zombies. As you level up, unlock and purchase new weapons to become even stronger. Just make sure to stock up on enough ammo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/bf9f1c77076478af514eaeea394eb19d.poster.avif?t=1786619183\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/bf9f1c77076478af514eaeea394eb19d.webm?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/bf9f1c77076478af514eaeea394eb19d.mp4?t=1786619183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Even a Graveyard Can Be Cozy Sometimes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Farming Area to grow different flowers for profit and vegetables to simply eat and restore