ng> help run sermons and services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every improvement helps you stay one step ahead of both business demands and the undead threat. Venture beyond the graveyard by unlocking <strong>Expedition Mode</strong> through the <strong>Expedition Station</strong>, where radio signals lead you to dangerous missions outside your walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and expand your own graveyard while balancing business and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and maintain defenses against nightly zombie attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform burials, cremations, urn deliveries, and keep visitors satisfied</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a Chapel with sermons, donations, and a Souvenir Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and manage a wide range of employees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft gravestones, customize urns, and produce valuable resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Expedition Mode and complete missions outside the graveyard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your Graveyard with benches, lights, paths, bushes and other ornaments to make it truly your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle with expanded game modifier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a mix of management, strategy, and first-person action</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Manage your Graveyard by day as you bury and cremate bodies, maintain graves, fulfill visitor requests, grow crops, run a shop and unlock upgrades. When night falls, face relentless zombie hordes as you build defenses to protect your work and fight to survive in Zombie Graveyard Simulator!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese